<div class="spec-line">Selected Work</div>
<h1>Things I <span>built</span></h1>
<p class="lede">
Projects are a really good way to stay sharp, so I did them. To stay even sharper, you can write about them. The following are some projects that had enough meat I could (and wanted) to write about. Most projects will live here <a href="/labs">Labs</a>, hopefully hosted - but probably a little rough. Click a project for my write-up.
</p>

<div class="project-grid">
  <% projects.forEach(function(project) { %>
    <a class="panel" href="/project/<%= project.slug %>">
      <span class="focus tl"></span><span class="focus tr"></span>
      <span class="focus bl"></span><span class="focus br"></span>
      <div class="panel-top">
        <h3 class="panel-title"><%= project.title %></h3>
        <span class="panel-readout"><%= project.status %></span>
      </div>
      <p class="panel-desc"><%= project.summary %></p>
      <div class="tags">
        <% project.tags.forEach(function(tag) { %>
          <span class="tag"><%= tag %></span>
        <% }); %>
      </div>
    </a>
  <% }); %>
</div>

